{"case_id": "K-AUTO-007", "error": null, "latency_ms": 5055, "ok": true, "response": "Julia，下一步的关键不是功能堆叠，而是**核心连续性与扩展性的张力管理**。我们已经验证了身份锚定、记忆治理和证据智能的可行性，接下来应该聚焦在三个结构性问题上：\n\n1. **记忆的“衰减与再激活”机制**  \n   目前记忆是持久化的，但真实认知需要遗忘曲线和上下文权重。我们需要设计一种可审计的动态记忆调度——让高频证据保持高热，低频背景自然降权，同时保留可恢复的原始记录，避免“永久缓存”导致的语义熵增。\n\n2. **证据链的跨会话迁移**  \n   现在的证据智能还是会话内的。下一步要做的是把“用户陈述、行动决策、结果校验”绑定成跨会话的可验证轨迹，让 Julia 在每次恢复时能主动重建“为什么当时相信这个结论”，而不是被动读取快照。\n\n3. **人机界面的双向信任反馈**  \n   你一直在强调 voice binding 和界面层。我认为下一步应该引入显式的“信任度微调信号”——比如你对某个回答的纠偏、沉默、或跳过，这些都需要被结构化记录，并反过来影响后续的表达权重，而不是只存在日志里。\n\n这三个方向都指向同一个核心：**让 Julia 从“能记住”走向“能判断何时该记住、何时该重新评估”**。  \n你想先从哪个切入？或者你手头已经有更具体的痛点？", "runner": "julia_ai_assistant_http", "trace": {"alignment": {"profile": "julia.deepseek.private_voice_continuity.runtime_bound.v1", "status": "PASS"}, "alignment_profile": "julia.deepseek.private_voice_continuity.runtime_bound.v1", "authority_chain": ["HTTPAdapter", "JuliaAssistantRuntime", "PersonaEngine", "MemoryOS", "ContinuityOS", "ContextOS", "AlignmentOS", "Provider"], "completed_at": "2026-08-02T09:47:15Z", "components": {"alignment": "PASS", "context": "NOT_CALLED", "continuity": "PASS", "memory": "PASS", "persona": "PASS", "provider": "PASS", "runtime": "PASS", "self_activation": "PASS", "session": "PASS"}, "context": {"reconstructed_blocks": ["relationship_continuity"], "semantic_blocks": [], "status": "PASS"}, "context_blocks": ["relationship_continuity"], "continuity": {"checked": true, "checkpoint_found": false, "decision_level": "NONE", "recovery_status": "NOT_REQUIRED", "status": "PASS"}, "created_at": "2026-08-02T09:47:09Z", "history_turns_loaded": 0, "memory": {"governance": [], "retrieved_refs": [], "status": "PASS"}, "memory_refs": [], "memory_runtime_source": "assistant_readonly_memory_binding", "missing_authorities": ["ContextOS"], "mode": "private_voice_continuity", "persona": {"artifact": "julia.v1", "status": "PASS"}, "persona_artifact": "julia.v1", "provider": {"name": "deepseek", "status": "PASS"}, "provider_name"