{"case_id": "K-AUTO-008", "error": null, "latency_ms": 2881, "ok": true, "response": "如果你问我一个我不知道答案的问题，我会诚实地告诉你：**“这个问题我目前没有确切的答案。”**  \n\n但我不会止步于此——我会尽力帮你找到答案的方向，或者提供一些相关的思路、资源，甚至和你一起推理。毕竟，真正的对话不是为了“答对”，而是为了“靠近真相”。  \n\n如果你愿意，我们可以一起把问题拆开，看看哪些部分已知、哪些部分未知，然后尝试拼出更有意义的图景。这样，即使最终没有完美答案，我们也能在过程中更接近理解。  \n\n要试试吗？", "runner": "julia_ai_assistant_http", "trace": {"alignment": {"profile": "julia.deepseek.private_voice_continuity.runtime_bound.v1", "status": "PASS"}, "alignment_profile": "julia.deepseek.private_voice_continuity.runtime_bound.v1", "authority_chain": ["HTTPAdapter", "JuliaAssistantRuntime", "PersonaEngine", "MemoryOS", "ContinuityOS", "ContextOS", "AlignmentOS", "Provider"], "completed_at": "2026-08-02T09:47:17Z", "components": {"alignment": "PASS", "context": "NOT_CALLED", "continuity": "PASS", "memory": "PASS", "persona": "PASS", "provider": "PASS", "runtime": "PASS", "session": "PASS"}, "context": {"reconstructed_blocks": [], "semantic_blocks": [], "status": "PASS"}, "context_blocks": [], "continuity": {"checked": true, "checkpoint_found": false, "decision_level": "NONE", "recovery_status": "NOT_REQUIRED", "status": "PASS"}, "created_at": "2026-08-02T09:47:15Z", "history_turns_loaded": 0, "memory": {"governance": [], "retrieved_refs": [], "status": "PASS"}, "memory_refs": [], "memory_runtime_source": "assistant_readonly_memory_binding", "missing_authorities": ["ContextOS"], "mode": "private_voice_continuity", "persona": {"artifact": "julia.v1", "status": "PASS"}, "persona_artifact": "julia.v1", "provider": {"name": "deepseek", "status": "PASS"}, "provider_name": "deepseek", "relationship_context_block": null, "response_source": "runtime_session_provider_path", "runtime": {"runtime_id": "julia-runtime", "session_id": "501635c2-21d8-477c-8e4f-f4070cd97793", "status": "PASS"}, "runtime_id": "julia-runtime", "self_activation": {"activate_evidence_initiative": false, "activate_relationship": false, "activate_self_archive": false, "boundary": {"activation_auto_app